COMMENT     VALIDATED REFSEQ: This record has undergone validation or
            preliminary review. The reference sequence was derived from
            BC032448.1.
            
            Transcript Variant: This variant (1) contains an alternate 5'
            sequence, which results in a downstream AUG start codon, compared
            to variant 2. The resulting isoform (1) has a shorter N-terminus,
            compared to isoform 2. Variants 1, 3 and 4 encode the same isoform
            1.
            
